     ochish (36), Paroldan nusxa olish (28), Keyingisi (39), Nusxa olindi (30); "Paste" is Android's
     "Joylash". An account's name, which the user typed, stands in quotes before a noun ("hisobi",
     "saytini") or the postposition "uchun", so that no suffix is glued to it (i18n.md §4.4). oʻ and
     gʻ with U+02BB, the tutuq belgisi with U+02BC. -->
